Error: HTTP 404: guest not found in inventory
Usage:
  umkim site host provision [site] [name] [flags]

Flags:
      --action string   install_bm | create_vm | plan_vm | destroy | discover | discover_pxe | status | prepare_hypervisor | prepare_gpu_passthrough | prepare_hypervisor_gpu (default from kind)
      --confirm         Required for install_bm / discover_pxe / destroy / prepare_gpu_passthrough / prepare_hypervisor_gpu
  -h, --help            help for provision
      --wait            Poll until Succeeded or Failed

Global Flags:
      --api-url string    Fleet API base URL (or UMKIM_API_URL)
      --auth-url string   Auth API base URL (or UMKIM_AUTH_URL)
  -o, --output string     Output format: table, wide, json (default "table")
      --token string      Service account token (or UMKIM_TOKEN)

